Package: swipeswitch
Version: 0.3.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SwipeSwitch Project <maintainers@swipeswitch.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-wnck-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, python3-pil, libinput-tools, coreutils, wmctrl
Description: touchpad-driven window and workspace navigation for X11
 SwipeSwitch provides three-finger window switching, Task View,
 Show Desktop/restoration and four-finger XFCE workspace navigation.
 It uses GTK 3, libwnck and libinput on an X11 desktop session.
